"P2167503126" "Positron"
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P345188948" "This is a most concerning message, {HeroName}!<br><br>I find it intriguing, however, that the Rikti threat scanners use a similar color code to identify classifications of threats. If I understand this correctly, he considers all Earthlings to be threat level grey, or no challenge.<br><br>Fascinating, perhaps their visual organs are not so different from our own... with a wide band of color recognition, which is definitely reinforced by the coloration of many of their battle suits..."
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P4280713698" "Blue Steel"
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P2664478508" "The city needs the best. That includes you, {HeroName}.<br><br>What's this?<br><br><color orange>Blue Steel reads the message on your phone and his mouth draws into an even finer line.</color><br><br>U'Kon is in for a surprise, {HeroName}. Threat scanners can't read me, because I don't make threats... I make promises."
// Script Variable VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P2528907233" "A message appears on your cell phone in the Rikti alphabet. A moment later it is translated into the following message:"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P2442303775" "<i>Intended Recipient: Positron.<br>Introduction of self: U'Kon Gr'ai.<br>Subject: Earthlings too weak.<br>Consideration: Earth's surrender.<br>Reason: You cannot survive.<br>Request: Worthy adversaries.<br>Purpose: Improvement of battle skills.<br>Conclusion: You are grey to my threat scanner.</i><br><br><color yellow>This appears to be a message from the Rikti Master at Arms, U'Kon Gr'ai, to Positron, in which he claims that Earthlings are too weak to challenge his battle skills and that Earth should surrender because we cannot survive any other way. This could mean an impending Rikti assault; Positron should be informed immediately!<br><br>On the other hand, this sort of bravado is nearly unheard of from the Rikti, and you know someone who would be more than happy to challenge this U'Kon Gr'ai to a battle royale... Blue Steel.</color>"
// Script Variable SENDER_NAME :
"P3163887778" "U'Kon Gr'ai"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P4068192727" "Your phone has a translated Rikti message from the Rikti Master at Arms, U'Kon Gr'ai, to Positron demanding Earth's surrender because they are weak."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3668577043" "Reconsider your options"
