"P3860943911" "Rick Davies"
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P334648262" "Well, I didn't expect that. Valerie is a nice girl, but I have a strict policy not to date my patients. Especially ones undergoing personal identity issues. Still, she's obviously reaching out and trying to feel normal again, to figure out who she is and how she fits in...<br><br>Susan is never going to let me live this down if I take her out, and if I don't who knows how Valkyrie will take it..."
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P4069331086" "Tony Kord"
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P3054600666" "Valerie? Valerie Kellum.<br><br>I don't think I've spoken to her in years, but obviously she hasn't been paying attention to my dating life, because Ms. Kellum is exactly the type of tall blonde bombshell I go for. I'll have to take her up on that offer. I mean, it's just one little date, right?"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P1468475977" "You find a simple letter written on a folded piece of heavy paper. It reads:"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P3554303337" "<i>Dr. Raymond Keyes trusts you and so thus I trust you. Trust and honor means everything to me.  I am trying to be true to the woman I used to be, to try and give her what she would want, and I believe in you I have found her heart's desire. This is why I have decided, on this fertility holiday, to express my interest in you in the hopes that together we can forge a relationship that is deeper than just friends and fellow warriors. What is your answer?<br>-Valkyrie and Valerie Kellum</i><br><br><color yellow>Sounds like Rick Davies has got a hot date with Valerie Kellum, the nanite infused super heroine known as Valkyrie. Of course, nothing on here suggests that it is for Rick other than you knowing that D.A.T.A. has been working with Valkyrie to study her nanotechnology, but you know that Valerie is just the type of girl Tony Kord would like to get to know better, if only so he could have a look at what makes her powers tick.</color>"
// Script Variable SENDER_NAME :
"P605437514" "Valkyrie"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P1717590851" "This letter is from Valerie Kellum, the heroine known as Valkyrie, and appears to be intended for Rick Davies."
